From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 14:47:19 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 51/76] flashnext cuda: the prefill lanes behind load-time
 switches, all off by default

TF_FLASHNEXT_HIDDEN_SUM (owner-order slot sum, --tp 2 hidden-size exchange), TF_FLASHNEXT_OWNER_SLOTS (owner-slot
prompt exchange) and TF_FLASHNEXT_GDN_SPLIT (split DeltaNet prompt chain), each read once at load; unset keeps the
recipe's sums, exchanges and kernels. The two exchange switches join the rank identity, and HIDDEN_SUM is bit 2 of the
kept-prompt-state policy key.
